    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Village&quot; is a micro thriller of suspense works. This work is a mixture of terror, reasoning, suspense and other mixed elements, which is worth playing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Introduction<br />\r\nIn this work, you play a country doctor who just graduated from university. What seems to be a quiet and peaceful village is a mystery.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe content of the game is real and intense, with a strong sense of bringing in! Can you survive in this village under many crises? The true story behind the village is waiting for you to discover!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\n&quot;Strong logic&quot;: Players need to be careful with every choice after reasoning. If they are not careful, they may die.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Brilliant characterization&quot;: The character portrayal of the work is excellent. Everyone has his or her own secret<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Multiple outcomes experience&quot;: High freedom of choice, there are a variety of different routes available, each with a unique landscape.",
